WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.220
An organization with as many secrets as&nbsp;
the SCP Foundation requires the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:10.800
to dispose of material that could prove harmful&nbsp;
to the facade of normalcy that the 05 council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.440
desperately wishes to uphold. And because most&nbsp;
of the high-ranking researchers are a bit too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:22.200
smart and practical to simply flush classified&nbsp;
documents and unwanted objects down the toilet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.860
the means that the Foundation uses to get&nbsp;
rid of evidence has to be thorough enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:31.200
to guarantee that absolutely no trace of&nbsp;
what needs to be disposed of survives.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.140
For this purpose, several waste disposal plants&nbsp;
are used as front companies for The Foundation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:43.560
and function internally as a foolproof way to&nbsp;
liquidate hazardous material and compromising&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:49.260
information. But not all secrets are so&nbsp;
easily forgotten with the push of a button,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:55.260
and a rare few can prove too resilient to&nbsp;
be burned away. This is the regrettable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:02.040
case of the anomalies contained with the&nbsp;
site now designated SCP-2419 - a place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.260
where the unfortunate consequence of amnestic&nbsp;
experiments has led to the creation of hateful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:12.660
immortal humanoids fated to be sealed&nbsp;
within the incinerators of the facility.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:20.580
These undead freaks are known as SCP-2419-A,&nbsp;
and though they were made from human bodies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:26.520
the consciousness that dwells within each&nbsp;
instance is nothing short of pure evil.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:31.740
Every happy memory and associated positive&nbsp;
emotion was extracted from the brains of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:39.120
SCP-2419-A corpses prior to their attempted&nbsp;
disposal in the incinerators. This was done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:43.800
in order to increase the effectiveness&nbsp;
of standard issue Foundation amnestics,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:48.840
but the cost of this minor breakthrough was&nbsp;
that these bodies - all of which were once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:55.680
D-Class personnel - had effectively been stripped&nbsp;
of all human qualities. Given the sorts of violent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.560
criminal backgrounds that earns an individual the&nbsp;
designation of D-class personnel, these former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:07.380
humans were the last people that should have been&nbsp;
deprived of the love and joy in their hearts.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:13.500
And when the first of these psychopathic Laughing&nbsp;
Men crawled out of one of SCP-2419’s incinerators,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.660
the Foundation learned all too well what&nbsp;
an uninhibited criminal mind looked like.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:24.540
Driven only by the rage and fury that inspired&nbsp;
their most gruesome acts of exploitation and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:30.960
violence in life, their pain has made them&nbsp;
too hateful to succumb to the flames. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:36.300
are the archetypal sinners of a burning hell&nbsp;
that the Foundation’s best intentions paved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:41.880
the road to. And when they break loose,&nbsp;
all that hell breaks loose with them.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:47.820
But no place of the damned leaves its gates&nbsp;
unguarded. Dante’s Inferno posits that the ancient&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:53.520
Greek mythological figure Minos, serpentine&nbsp;
father of the minotaur and judge of wicked souls,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:59.820
guards the pit of Hell with stern vigilance. The&nbsp;
Greeks themselves favored the image of cerberus,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:06.000
a three-headed hound that served its lord hades&nbsp;
as a watchdog. For the ancient Egyptians, there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.520
was Ammut, the devourer of the dead, who consumed&nbsp;
the hearts of the unrighteous in the afterlife.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:15.360
While this sort of guardian beast is not&nbsp;
officially on the Foundation’s payroll,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:19.380
the concept turned out to be alive&nbsp;
and well in the present day when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:24.840
SCP-682 - the hard-to-destroy reptile&nbsp;
- stood against the Laughing Man and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:28.380
gave them the fight of their&nbsp;
tortured unliving existence.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:35.340
It all began when the guards stationed at SCP-2419&nbsp;
began to hear banging from the inside of one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:41.760
the incinerators. It seemed as though the&nbsp;
SCP-2419-A instance on the other side was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:46.320
determined to breach containment, so&nbsp;
Mobile Task Force Beta-7 - “The Maz&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:50.640
Hatters” - were called in to stand with&nbsp;
all weapons at the ready. But this was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:55.260
exactly what the instance wanted. As soon&nbsp;
as the armed force had fully assembled,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.260 --> 00:04:00.240
the Laughing Man inside ripped the metal door&nbsp;
from its hinges. It proceeded to use it as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:05.580
cover and run full speed towards the mobile&nbsp;
task force, who opened fire immediately.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:11.160
SCP-2419-A were known to possess&nbsp;
extremely fast regenerative abilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:18.120
so it would take a lot of punishment to slow this&nbsp;
instance down. But this was no unthinking zombie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:22.980
and the instance broke its charge the second it&nbsp;
was in the midst of the mobile task force agents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:28.080
to twirl the door around like a trained martial&nbsp;
artist. This not only sent the incoming bullets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:32.760
ricocheting everywhere - causing many of the&nbsp;
Beta-7 operatives to be hit by their own friendly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:37.860
fire - it also allowed the instance to bludgeon&nbsp;
several agents with the sides of the door.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.280
As the remaining mobile task&nbsp;
force members retreated to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.940
less exposed vantage point where&nbsp;
they could employ heavy artillery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:49.680
the instance used this moment of confusion&nbsp;
to pitch the door backwards towards the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:54.480
incinerators in a boomerang trajectory. The&nbsp;
force and spin of the door knocked two more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.480 --> 00:05:02.100
incinerator doors off their hinges, and caused&nbsp;
two other instances of SCP-2419-A to emerge.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:06.540
One, who was so thoroughly decomposed that&nbsp;
it appeared to be little more than a flaming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:12.960
skeleton, sprinted forth and threw handfuls of&nbsp;
hot cinders at the Foundation agents. It used its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:18.540
still-burning body to ignite a few of the closest&nbsp;
agents, laughing with sadistic glee as it did so.&nbsp;

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:23.700
Seconds after the emergence of the two new&nbsp;
instances, a grenade launcher was fired at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:28.440
the first escapee. The blast was enough to&nbsp;
deal significant damage, but the instance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:33.240
was indifferent to its own pain. It pointed&nbsp;
to the agent wielding the grenade launcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:38.760
and a moment later, the third instance was at&nbsp;
the agent's throat, strangling him to death.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:42.900
It was starting to become clear to the&nbsp;
Mobile Task Force that this was no random&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:48.840
containment breach. It was a coordinated escape&nbsp;
attempt by three ruthless criminal masterminds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:53.760
who in their time contained at the&nbsp;
site SCP-2419 had probably decided&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:58.740
there was some truth to the old adage&nbsp;
that “misery loves company.” And indeed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:04.500
these three D-class were some of the best of the&nbsp;
best when it came to being the worst of the worst.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:11.520
D-1576 - Formerly Police Lieutenant Campbell&nbsp;
Farage, a riot cop with a serious taste for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:15.960
carnage. Whenever the streets of the city&nbsp;
precinct he presided over turned violent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:21.720
Farage always made sure that the violence didn’t&nbsp;
die down too quickly. His nasty penchant for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:27.120
bludgeoning suspects and citizens alike with his&nbsp;
riot shield did wonders for the escape plan he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:32.580
had coordinated with his fellow Laughing Men.&nbsp;
He was eventually tried and sent to a supermax&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:37.980
after picking a fight with several other officers&nbsp;
in the line of duty, a fight that resulted in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:43.680
pair of rookie officers who opposed his violent&nbsp;
methods being hospitalized with permanent comas.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:50.820
The skeleton was D-4483 - Damien Lambert,&nbsp;
a prolific arsonist who terrorized three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:56.400
counties while avoiding detection under the guise&nbsp;
of being a sovereign citizen. If there was ever a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:02.100
person who just wanted to watch the world burn, it&nbsp;
was Damien Lambert. He was caught in the process&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:06.420
of setting fire to an elementary school, and&nbsp;
was thankfully apprehended before any of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:10.980
kerosene he had poured through the halls ignited.&nbsp;
When the truth about his previous history of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:17.160
pyromania came out, Lambert faced death row until&nbsp;
the Foundation chose to recruit him as a D-class.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:24.840
Then, there was D-2316 - Arnold Roper - who&nbsp;
was better known as The Illinois Strangler,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:29.820
responsible for over 50 deaths in&nbsp;
two decades before he was arrested&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:35.040
and detained. While he mostly used his&nbsp;
bare hands to do the deed, Roper was fond&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:40.140
of using metal chains and heavy-duty choke&nbsp;
collars usually worn by animals to perform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:45.960
his namesake act of violence. Roper wasn’t&nbsp;
just brutally strong, he was crafty too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:51.480
and the trio of laughing men had him to thank&nbsp;
for some of the finer points of the escape plan.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:57.120
These three now-immortal D-class also had one&nbsp;
other thing in common: each of them had met&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:04.080
the ends of their cruel and violent lives at&nbsp;
the jaws and claws of SCP-682. And now that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:09.300
they had outmaneuvered and slaughtered Mobile&nbsp;
Task Force Beta-7, their only collective goal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:15.060
was to get revenge on the monster that condemned&nbsp;
them all to the fiery hell of the incinerator.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:21.000
The Laughing Men soon breached the limits&nbsp;
of the SCP-2419 containment site and began&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.980
making their way overland towards the facility&nbsp;
where all of them had met their original fate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:31.080
They knew they needed wheels to get there, so&nbsp;
instances made their way to the nearest gas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:36.180
station to the waste disposal plant they’d&nbsp;
come from and made short work of the staff.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:41.580
Lambert stocked up on lighters, kerosene, and&nbsp;
duraflame, while Farage took the emergency&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.840
shotgun that the cashier hadn’t&nbsp;
had time to fire. In her defense,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:50.520
it would have been difficult to accomplish&nbsp;
much of anything with Roper’s hands clasped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:55.260
around her throat. Once the trio of undead&nbsp;
psychopaths had stocked up on weapons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:00.600
they waited for a suitable vehicle to pull&nbsp;
into the lot. And before long, there it was.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:07.080
A family SUV, with a happy family inside,&nbsp;
no less. Farage ordered Lambert to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:12.000
his fire-starting tendencies in check, as a&nbsp;
gas station explosion was the last thing they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.860
needed right now. The former riot cop made&nbsp;
his way out to the car and used the shotgun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:22.020
to threaten the family out of the car. Family&nbsp;
road trips can be stressful, but rarely does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:27.360
one expect to be carjacked by a gang of the&nbsp;
undead. Farage told the unlucky mortals that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:32.880
he wouldn’t hurt them if they let himself and his&nbsp;
two friends use their car, and true to his word,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:39.000
he didn’t fire a single shot. The family were&nbsp;
all added to Roper’s list of victims instead.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.380
After that, the bad men took the wheel&nbsp;
and - with only their hazy memories of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:48.120
pain and suffering to guide them - drove&nbsp;
relentlessly towards the Foundation Facility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:53.880
where their enemy SCP-682 was contained.&nbsp;
The three had made sure to leave no human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:58.320
alive at their original containment&nbsp;
site and would allow no witnesses who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.760
saw their anomalous corpse-like forms to&nbsp;
survive. They couldn’t afford to give the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:07.200
Foundation a heads up that the reckoning&nbsp;
was on its way in a family motor vehicle.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:10.440
Meanwhile, at the Laughing&nbsp;
Men’s intended destination,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:15.840
SCP-682 was having another perfectly&nbsp;
routine day of painfully soaking in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.680
a tank of corrosive acid. This was&nbsp;
par for the course for the reptile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:25.920
and it found itself as eager as anyone stuck in a&nbsp;
rut to get a break from the repetitive mundanity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:31.800
of containment. Little did the human-hating&nbsp;
monster know, it would soon get its wish.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:36.240
A few hours later, the facility was shocked&nbsp;
to find that several fires had been lit at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.820
the fringes of the testing units. These were no&nbsp;
freak accidents, but rather the work of Damien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.840
Lambert. The arsonist still had memories&nbsp;
of all the times he wished he could have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:50.280
burned his jailor’s buildings to the ground&nbsp;
and had targeted the most vulnerable areas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:54.780
for combustion. The flames threatened the&nbsp;
integrity of several areas of the facility,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:59.940
and multiple containment breaches were imminent&nbsp;
if the blaze couldn’t be kept under control.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:04.980
While any available agents with fire-fighting&nbsp;
experience sought to minimize the damage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:09.960
the researchers evacuated to safer parts&nbsp;
of the building, bringing any sensitive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:15.840
documents and flammable items far away from the&nbsp;
affected sections. This kind of pandemonium was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:20.580
exactly where Officer Farage thrived,&nbsp;
and he soon entered the fray, causing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:25.800
enough commotion that Roper was able to slip&nbsp;
deeper into the facility completely undetected.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:30.960
This turned out to be the perfect role for the&nbsp;
Strangler, as he hadn’t eluded the police for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.880
twenty years of his life just by being lucky.&nbsp;
Farage and Lambert would both join up with him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:40.860
after they were finished having their fun. For&nbsp;
now, his task was to locate the containment unit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:47.460
of SCP-682 and give the beast a taste of&nbsp;
what the trio had in store. Along the way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.600
he made sure to obtain some durable metal&nbsp;
chains from a different containment unit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:57.120
He likely released some kind of elder evil in&nbsp;
the process, but Roper didn’t care about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:03.120
consequences. The bottom line was that he was&nbsp;
always able to do best work when he was armed.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:08.100
It wasn’t long before he found the large&nbsp;
chamber which housed his most hated foe:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:14.340
SCP-682. Roper laughed maniacally as he&nbsp;
approached the creature floating in its acid tank.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:18.900
“Remember me, lizard?” The strangler&nbsp;
said, sporting a wide grin.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:24.180
The monster simply growled back at Roper,&nbsp;
wishing to tear him apart. Roper chuckled again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.320
and wrapped the iron chains around the&nbsp;
vat. With all the considerable strength&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:32.460
of his immortal muscles, the strangler&nbsp;
pulled the chains taught and shattered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:38.160
SCP-682’s containment unit. The anomalous chains&nbsp;
snared the creature's body, holding it in place.

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:44.640
“How about now?” Roper taunted 682. He&nbsp;
laughed, but the creature laughed back.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:52.080
“No,” said the reptile. “I don’t&nbsp;
remember you, but you are disgusting.”

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:58.140
The monster lunged towards a nearby wall&nbsp;
and burst through, dragging Roper along&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:03.600
with it by his chains still wrapped around&nbsp;
the creature’s body. 682 twisted and turned,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:08.580
flinging Roper against every wall and&nbsp;
obstacle in sight, but to its surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:13.860
the strangler was regenerating, and&nbsp;
his grip on the chains was unyielding.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:17.940
Back down the hall, Farage was still&nbsp;
continuing his rampage when he ran into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:24.780
an unlikely adversary. Dr. Alto Clef stood between&nbsp;
the Laughing Man and the other researchers, and as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:30.240
usual, the good doctor was packing heat. He told&nbsp;
the other researchers to go on without him while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:37.500
he contained the SCP-2419 instance on his own. A&nbsp;
bold move, to be sure, but Dr. Clef had made the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:42.780
same mistake he was always making by assuming&nbsp;
that guns were the solution to this problem.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:47.400
Farage laughed off the bullets and slammed&nbsp;
into Dr. Clef with enough force to leave a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:51.660
crater in the wall behind him. He followed&nbsp;
up with a merciless barrage of punches,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:56.340
beating the armed researcher senseless&nbsp;
and only relenting for a moment to steal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:56.340 --> 00:14:01.380
a few of his prized firearms. With a blow that&nbsp;
would have taken the life of any normal man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:06.240
Farage struck Dr. Clef once more and&nbsp;
left him lying there a hair’s length&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:11.400
from death. Dr. Clef’s anti-anomaly field&nbsp;
may have protected him from reality warpers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:16.740
but it did very little against being&nbsp;
kicked repeatedly, very hard, in the face.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.980
Elsewhere, Lambert had made&nbsp;
his way inside the facility,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:25.380
setting more fires as he went. The arsonist’s&nbsp;
skeleton was a terrifying sight to all that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:29.760
beheld it and when the guards realized that&nbsp;
none of their weapons would have an effect,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.020
most of them started to run away&nbsp;
from Lambert rather than towards him.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:38.760
All three laughing men would soon&nbsp;
be upon SCP-682, and then the fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:43.620
of their afterlives could truly begin.&nbsp;
Until that moment, Roper was buying his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:49.200
partners in hatred more time. The chains he had&nbsp;
stolen were no ordinary metal, and with them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:55.020
he had managed to keep 682’s jaws shut while&nbsp;
he pounded away at its exposed ribs with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:55.020 --> 00:15:00.540
inhuman strength. Roper had killed more people&nbsp;
than either of his former D-class compatriots,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:05.460
but all of that seemed to mean nothing&nbsp;
in the face of this invincible reptile.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:10.380
The shame and powerlessness he had once felt&nbsp;
as the creature had mauled him to death made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:15.060
his immortal heart beat with outrage. When&nbsp;
he was alive, the Illinois Strangler had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:21.000
always thought that his gift for murder made him&nbsp;
better than the average person: a man among men.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:26.340
But this thing had made him feel weak in his&nbsp;
last moments of humanity, and that sickening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:32.820
emotion of weakness was still sliding around in&nbsp;
his soul with all of the other despair and malice.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:37.020
If his fate were to live forever as a&nbsp;
dead man walking, then he would make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:43.020
damn sure that any humiliation he suffered&nbsp;
would be paid back threefold. This soup of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:48.420
impotent fury bubbled within Roper as&nbsp;
SCP-682’s strength suddenly increased,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:53.280
shattering the weak link of the chains and&nbsp;
sending the hapless strangler flying backwards.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:58.500
At that precise moment, Farage leaped&nbsp;
out of a nearby hallway and unleashed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:03.120
Dr. Clef’s arsenal on the reptile. This&nbsp;
sustained fire irritated the creature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:08.220
and it turned its focus towards the unliving&nbsp;
dirty cop. It readied a charge only to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:14.100
suddenly held fast by Roper, who had grabbed its&nbsp;
tail. Farage fired until there was no more ammo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.040
then pistol-whipped the creature&nbsp;
in both of its eye sockets.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:22.860
SCP-682 thrashed and struggled, so the men&nbsp;
began to circle the reptile and alternate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:27.480
delivering formidable body blows. They took&nbsp;
far more damage than they could dish out with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.740
their bare hands, but the regeneration&nbsp;
that their preternatural hatred granted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:36.180
them meant that both instances could&nbsp;
theoretically keep this up all day.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:40.320
Roper grabbed a broken length of the&nbsp;
anomalous chain, while Farage picked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:45.240
up a metal table for use as a makeshift&nbsp;
riot shield. The beatdown continued as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:49.980
SCP-682’s eyes regenerated, along&nbsp;
with several new sensory organs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:54.480
give it a full 360-degree view of the&nbsp;
pitched brawl that was taking place.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:59.100
A fiery explosion blew open a&nbsp;
nearby wall, and in walked Lambert,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:05.820
still skeletal and laughing as uproariously as&nbsp;
ever. He threw a Molotov cocktail at 682’s back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:10.920
causing the creature to ignite immediately.&nbsp;
The reptile roared in sudden agony.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:15.780
Farage, Lambert, Roper regrouped at the&nbsp;
creature’s flank and pushed together until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:19.080
they forced it back through the hole&nbsp;
where the arsonist had entered from.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:24.360
They were now altogether in the inferno&nbsp;
- the three laughing men who refused to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:28.740
die and the indestructible monster&nbsp;
that made them into what they were.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:32.760
Roper quickly knotted the chains and wrapped&nbsp;
them around one of the creature’s claws,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:38.100
securing the other end around his waist.&nbsp;
Like a trained boxer, he bobbed and weaved,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:43.860
pummeling the beast with all he had. Any&nbsp;
step back from SCP-682 was meant with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:48.780
immortal man shifting his entire body weight&nbsp;
to pull the creature’s leg out from under it.

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:53.880
Farage wedged his shield into the creature’s&nbsp;
open jaw, widening it to an uncomfortable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:59.820
degree and temporarily limiting 682’s bite&nbsp;
force. He took out the shotgun he had stolen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:04.980
from the gas station and blasted it down the&nbsp;
reptile’s gullet. When that plan ran its course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:09.600
he started clubbing 682 about its neck&nbsp;
and head with the butt of the shotgun.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.500
Lambert simply continued to douse the&nbsp;
area with more flammable material,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:19.860
especially himself and the creature. He climbed&nbsp;
onto 682’s back with his burning bones and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:25.020
hammered away at its defenses with literal&nbsp;
fists of fire. The arsonist was incapable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:30.000
of articulate speech due to the damage to his&nbsp;
body prior to his death, but if he could speak,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:35.820
he would probably be celebrating the fact that he&nbsp;
had become what he had always wanted to be. Damien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:42.840
Lambert was no mere pretender with a fetish for&nbsp;
fire: he was fire itself. A brightly-burning god&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:49.680
of destruction that left no inch of the world&nbsp;
unburnt and no molecule of oxygen unconsumed.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:53.280
His mother and father would be&nbsp;
proud of him as they waited in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:57.120
Hell for the son who would never&nbsp;
arrive: the son who would make the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:01.740
planet they left behind into a true&nbsp;
hell where he would reign supreme.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:09.000
That is, until SCP-682 stole that dream out from&nbsp;
under him. With a flash of blue and green from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:14.640
deep within, 682 began to burn with a never&nbsp;
before seen chemical reaction: an impossible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:20.880
event that could only be described as anti-fire.&nbsp;
The turquoise anti-flames devoured the orange and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:26.640
yellow ones, leaving Lambert in a state of panic -&nbsp;
which was soon shared by his fellow Laughing Men.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:31.800
The three former D-Class had gotten so used&nbsp;
to the torments of the incinerator that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:36.900
idea that anything could be more painful had&nbsp;
never occurred to them. And yet, here it was,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:43.380
the anti-fire, which devoured all flames and&nbsp;
directly inflicted unimaginable suffering to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:48.900
trio of instances. Every particle of their still&nbsp;
regenerating bodies felt like it was ice cold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:55.140
and melting into nothingness at the same time.&nbsp;
Numbed and broken all over again, the laughing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:55.140 --> 00:20:00.660
men were consumed all over by the anti flames&nbsp;
and fell into a state of suspended animation.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:04.860
With the Foundation finally getting&nbsp;
everything back under control 24 hours later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:10.500
SCP-682 was contained in a new acidic&nbsp;
chamber. There were some new ordinances&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:15.420
from all present and surviving researchers&nbsp;
about exposing it to fire - as the anti-flames&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:19.800
it produced were considered too hazardous&nbsp;
to ever exist within the facility again.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:25.320
As for the three laughing men who had&nbsp;
escaped from SCP-2419: they were returned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:29.520
to their containment units inside of the&nbsp;
incinerators and never exhibited signs of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:34.680
aggression or escape attempts ever again.&nbsp;
A psychological profile of Farage, Lambert,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:40.320
and Roper that all of them could still feel the&nbsp;
sting of the burns left by 682’s antifire to this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:46.680
day, and that not even exposure to natural&nbsp;
heat and fire could ever reduce that pain.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:52.380
Now go check out “Could SCP-682 be Contained&nbsp;
in the Backrooms?” and “Evil Monster Created&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:59.700
by SCP Foundation SCP-2419 - The Laughing Men” for&nbsp;
more of today’s terrifying combatants in action!

